" title=\"HasVerbalComponent (spell flag)\">HasVerbalComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsConcentration_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsConcentration (spell flag)\">IsConcentration</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsSpell_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsSpell (spell flag)\">IsSpell</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Area:_Black_Tentacles\"> Area: Black Tentacles </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Black_Tentacles\" title=\"Black Tentacles\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Black_Tentacles_surface_Icon.webp/30px-Black_Tentacles_surface_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f6/Black_Tentacles_surface_Icon.webp/45px-Black_Tentacles_surface_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f6/Black_Tentacles_surface_Icon.webp/60px-Black_Tentacles_surface_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Black Tentacles\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Black_Tentacles_surface_Icon.webp/30px-Black_Tentacles_surface_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f6/Black_Tentacles_surface_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Black_Tentacles\" title=\"Black Tentacles\">Black Tentacles</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 10  turns</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/38px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"AoE: 6 m (20 ft) Radius\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> AoE: 6 m (20 ft) Radius</p>\n<div>\n<p>Squirming, ebony tentacles fill the area, turning it into <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Difficult_Terrain_(Condition)\" title=\"Difficult Terrain (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Difficult Terrain\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Difficult_Terrain_(Condition)\" title=\"Difficult Terrain (Condition)\">Difficult Terrain</a>, and dealing <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\">3~18</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/25px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/38px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/50px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bludgeoning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/25px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\">Bludgeoning</span></a> damage to all creatures entering it and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Black_Tentacles_(Condition)\" title=\"Black Tentacles (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Black_Tentacles_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Black_Tentacles_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Black_Tentacles_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Black_Tentacles_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Black_Tentacles_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Black_Tentacles_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Smothering\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Black_Tentacles_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Black_Tentacles_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Black_Tentacles_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Black_Tentacles_(Condition)\" title=\"Black Tentacles (Condition)\">Smothering</a> them.\n</p>\n</div>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/38px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Condition Type Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Type: <a href=\"/wiki/Area#Surface\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Area\">Surface</a></dd>\n\n</dl><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Black_Tentacles\"> Condition: Black Tentacles </span></h3>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Black_Tentacles_(Condition)\" title=\"Black Tentacles (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Black_Tentacles_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Black_Tentacles_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Black_Tentacles_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Black_Tentacles_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Black_Tentacles_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Black_Tentacles_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Black Tentacles\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Black_Tentacles_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Black_Tentacles_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Black_Tentacles_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Black_Tentacles_(Condition)\" title=\"Black Tentacles (Condition)\">Black Tentacles</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"STR Save (Spell save DC)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">STR</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">Save</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Dice_rolls#Spell_save_DC\" title=\"Dice rolls\">Spell save DC</a>)</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Restrained by dark tendrils. Affected entity can't move and takes <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\">3d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bludgeoning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\">Bludgeoning</span></a> damage per turn.</li></ul>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a> against the affected entity have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a>, while the entity's Attack Rolls and <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a> have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> <h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Difficult_Terrain\"> Condition: Difficult Terrain </span></h3>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Difficult_Terrain_(Condition)\" title=\"Difficult Terrain (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Difficult Terrain\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Difficult_Terrain_(Condition)\" title=\"Difficult Terrain (Condition)\">Difficult Terrain</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Movement_Speed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Movement Speed\">Movement Speed</a> halved</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div></span>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\nClasses: <ul><li> Class level 7: <a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">Wizard</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/The_Great_Old_One\" title=\"The Great Old One\">The Great Old One</a></li></ul>\n<p>Granted by items:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Strange_Tendril_Amulet\" title=\"Strange Tendril Amulet\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Amulet_Necklace_B_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Amulet_Necklace_B_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Amulet_Necklace_B_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Amulet_Necklace_B_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Amulet_Necklace_B_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Amulet_Necklace_B_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Amulet_Necklace_B_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Amulet_Necklace_B_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Amulet_Necklace_B_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Strange_Tendril_Amulet\" title=\"Strange Tendril Amulet\">Strange Tendril Amulet</a></span> (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Long rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Other ways to learn:<br>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">Wizards</a> with <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/30px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">Level 4 Spell Slots</a> can <a href=\"/wiki/Transcribing_scrolls\" title=\"Transcribing scrolls\">transcribe</a> a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Evard%27s_Black_Tentacles\" title=\"Scroll of Evard's Black Tentacles\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Scroll_of_Evard%27s_Black_Tentacles_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Scroll_of_Evard%27s_Black_Tentacles_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Scroll_of_Evard%27s_Black_Tentacles_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Scroll_of_Evard%27s_Black_Tentacles_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Scroll_of_Evard%27s_Black_Tentacles_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Scroll_of_Evard%27s_Black_Tentacles_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Scroll_of_Evard%27s_Black_Tentacles_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Scroll_of_Evard%27s_Black_Tentacles_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Scroll_of_Evard%27s_Black_Tentacles_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Evard%27s_Black_Tentacles\" title=\"Scroll of Evard's Black Tentacles\">Scroll of Evard's Black Tentacles</a> to their spellbooks.</li></ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Black_Tentacles_(Condition)\" title=\"Black Tentacles (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Black_Tentacles_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Black_Tentacles_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Black_Tentacles_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Black_Tentacles_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Black_Tentacles_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Black_Tentacles_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Black Tentacles\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Black_Tentacles_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Black_Tentacles_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Black_Tentacles_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Black_Tentacles_(Condition)\" title=\"Black Tentacles (Condition)\">Black Tentacles</a> condition has two possible effects: it can prevent a character from moving, and it can deal damage.</li>\n<li>There is a saving throw for restraining, and restraining may happen\n<ul><li>when the spell is cast</li>\n<li>at the beginning of a character's turn</li>\n<li>when re-entering the area.</li></ul></li>\n<li>Damage is dealt only at the beginning of the turn when a character fails the save <em>and</em> also had the condition before the turn.</li>\n<li>An affected character seems to lose all movement speed, but actually the duration of this condition is only applied <em>whilst on its surface</em>; this means that movement speed is returned if the character escapes the surface, for example by using <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Misty_Step\" title=\"Misty Step\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Misty_Step_Icon.webp/20px-Misty_Step_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Misty_Step_Icon.webp/30px-Misty_Step_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Misty_Step_Icon.webp/40px-Misty_Step_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Misty Step\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Misty_Step_Icon.webp/20px-Misty_Step_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1f/Misty_Step_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Misty_Step\" title=\"Misty Step\">Misty Step</a>. As a comparison, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Enwebbed_(Condition)\" title=\"Enwebbed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Enwebbed_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Enwebbed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Enwebbed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Enwebbed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Enwebbed_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Enwebbed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Enwebbed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Enwebbed_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Enwebbed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Enwebbed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Enwebbed_(Condition)\" title=\"Enwebbed (Condition)\">Enwebbed</a> has duration of 1, so escaping the webbed surface does not return the movement speed.</li>\n<li>If a character is dealt damage by a weapon (at least, spells and fists do not appear to have this effect) earlier in the same round, it is not affected when the spell is cast. However, if later in the same turn such a character moves in the affected surface, they will need to make the saving throw.</li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Visuals\"> Visuals </span></h2>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><div class=\"embedvideo-wrapper embedvideo--local-embed-style\" style=\"position: relative;\"><div class=\"embedvideo-localEmbedStyle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"embedvideo-overlay\"><div class=\"embedvideo-loader\"><div class=\"embedvideo-loader__fakeButton\">Play Video</div><div class=\"embedvideo-loader__footer\"><div class=\"embedvideo-loader__service\">Local File</div></div></div></div></div><video src=\"https://bg3.wiki/w/images/d/dc/Evard%27s_Black_Tentacles_Visuals.mp4\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 640px; height: auto;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://bg3.wiki/wiki/File:Evard%27s_Black_Tentacles_Visuals.mp4\">https://bg3.wiki/wiki/File:Evard%27s_Black_Tentacles_Visuals.mp4</a></video></div></span> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Evard%27s_black_tentacles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Evard's black tentacles\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Evard%27s_black_tentacles\">Evard's black tentacles</a></span> on the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class